    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just really dont want to pay for an ER visit if i dont have to, its so expensive. i have some ibuprofen and some leftover muscle relaxers from before the surgery... if i take a couple of those and just keep my leg up, will that help the swelling go down? i'd rather just try that for a day or two and see if it gets better.",
