      "content": "I understand your concern about expenses, but avoiding an ER visit may put your health at risk. Ibuprofen and muscle relaxers can help with pain and inflammation, but relying solely on self-medication without professional evaluation can delay proper diagnosis and treatment. Additionally, keeping your leg up may not address the underlying issue, and it's not recommended to wait a day or two for symptoms to resolve, especially if they're worsening or changing.",
